10 REM ON ... GOTO AND ON ... GOSUB: A MENU
20 PRINT "1) SAY HELLO   2) COUNT TO THREE   3) QUIT"
30 INPUT "CHOICE"; C
40 ON C GOTO 100, 200, 300
50 PRINT "PLEASE CHOOSE 1, 2 OR 3"
60 GOTO 30
100 PRINT "HELLO!"
110 GOTO 30
200 FOR I = 1 TO 3
210   ON I GOSUB 400, 410, 420
220 NEXT I
230 GOTO 30
300 PRINT "BYE"
310 END
400 PRINT "ONE": RETURN
410 PRINT "TWO": RETURN
420 PRINT "THREE": RETURN
